	"Name": "Wizard G.(akupo) Rasmodius Portraits Compatible with Romanceable Rasmodius",
	"Author": "yojire",
	"Description": "[size=3]I'm playing Stardew with my friends for the first time and we have the \"Romanceable Rasmodius\" mod installed, cause I like wizards.\n<br />\n<br />My farmer is supposed to be Vocaloid Kaito, so I thought it'd be really funny if drew a portrait that looked like Gakupo. It is. I tried to replicate the normal Stardew style. Idk if this appeals to anyone other than me, but you can have it in your game, if you want![/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=3]I drew the portrait, but the sprite is just a recolor.[/size]\n<br />[size=3][img width=96,height=100]https://i.imgur.com/QgfAOth.gif[/img][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=3][b]Installation instructions[/b][/size]\n<br />[color=#999999][size=3]Put the portrait in your mods folder and in the Romanceable Rasmodius[b]\u00A0[/b]settings, put Portrait Mode on \"NineExpressions\" and set the \"Portrait\" to custom.\u00A0[/size][/color]\n<br />\n<br />[color=#999999][size=3]If you want my quick sprite recolor, you can replace one of the sprites in the\u00A0 Romanceable Rasmodius mod with it.[/size][/color]\n<br />",
